{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "64b44e13b4bde8df4d1ba676447d9caa3bd10045684c695b89cd0a2a15fa0681", "ja": "To.新ユニット", "zh": "To.新组合", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6f7e2d2a3775a7f2b4a62adcc49c3405f76a63cf33ec6af5687ab8a2dbe8e00a", "ja": "社長に託された新曲を聴き、プロデューサー\nの脳裏に浮かんだのは、朋花、千鶴、可憐。\nしかし全員スケジュールが厳しい。迷いを見\nせるプロデューサーに、3人は強い意志で応\nじた。新ユニットが始動！", "zh": "听着社长托付的新曲，制作人脑海中浮现出朋花、千鹤、可怜的身影。然而三人的日程都十分紧张。面对犹豫不决的制作人，3人以坚定的意志作出了回应。新组合正式启动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "af93e7e0dd047e3de152c03e639e8ec5bf469e48173b225e9a17695dde73f6a6", "ja": "（さて……今からミーティングだけど、やっぱり\nスケジューリングが厳しい。進め方を考えないと）", "zh": "（那么……现在要开会了，可安排时间果然还是很困难。得想想该怎么推进才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "995da19d60f63db7037f8b30d6918ca26d0f4780f973d797c40979470c226879", "ja": "おはようございます～。あら、もしかして\n千鶴さんも今からミーティングですか～？", "zh": "早上好～。咦，难道千鹤小姐也要去开会吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "f27d3e49c00f0b6ca4e20acc0e91e3fcea574a17076880379414a18b50b00668", "ja": "ごきげんよう、朋花。ええ、わたくしも\n{$P$}から呼び出されましたの。", "zh": "早上好，朋花。是的，我也是被\n{$P$}叫来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "eec58823c3ef8fe0efa5e8b5784e810b05d74b2a09158d7077225e9fd1634bcf", "ja": "そうでしたか～。けれど{$P$}さん\n本人がいないのは、どういうことでしょう～？", "zh": "原来如此～可是，{$P$}先生本人不在，这又是怎么回事呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "4830628676b7326c58ef98c5844d404f7003db5c7bc8c534a361853e03c04c36", "ja": "聖母相手に遅刻とはいい度胸ですね～。\nこれは、厳しくしつけなければ……。", "zh": "竟敢迟到，让圣母等你，胆子真不小呢～。看来得好好管教一下才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "850497f65230e9d00c3008a83ba1446803c873a2bc01f3620cadf9e859437a13", "ja": "まあ、何かと忙しいようですし……。\nもう少しだけ待ってみましょう。", "zh": "嗯，毕竟他好像挺忙的……再稍微等一会儿吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1006_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f53a9a37efe5e5e2c981974ba0dae2dba5b29fb5409da31b20628d5a6b8be538", "ja": "お疲れさま、みんな。\n……顔を出すのが遅れて申し訳ない。", "zh": "辛苦了，大家。\n……这么晚才露面，抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "260cf0558a6d659f6894453cd96bac82985feb913983acd1ec8768bd429dd2c5", "ja": "{$P$}さん～？\n何をしていたんですか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生～？\n您去干什么了呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "1fc0efaf60d9858961935504feec45937a0b5b778db578923ea56f15cdb00b8d", "ja": "うわわっ！？　と、朋花！　会った途端に\n全力でプレッシャーをかけないでくれ！", "zh": "哇哇！？朋、朋花！一见面就别全力给我施加压力啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "95528cef64b7b0685d90b50c3f4d4777b61333238f1a237c6bfb9838162998aa", "ja": "ちょっとスケジュール調整をしてて……。\n先に言っておけばよかった、ゴメン。", "zh": "我刚才在调整日程……。早知道就该先说一声，对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "4a490b21138a1d7a63c1d532ef8cbf48b04a58fcda3870cf3a1e3f54963ab60e", "ja": "……。まあ、今日のところはいいでしょう～。\n以後、気をつけてくださいね～。", "zh": "……。算了，今天就放过你吧～\n今后可要注意哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1012_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "2bebe4aba48575e3bea7e6aaa7993acc0dd7915fe9dfe8a780aa5f581ce28452", "ja": "お、お疲れさまです……。\nあれ？　も、もう始まってましたか？", "zh": "辛、辛苦了……。\n咦？难、难道已经开始了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "38ea83ca717c68157eeb19de33d8645c44583a2ed11cb0e97d055e544cb2349b", "ja": "あら、可憐。お疲れさま。\nもしかして、可憐もメンバーですの？", "zh": "哎呀，可怜。辛苦了。\n难不成，可怜也是成员之一？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1015_045kar", "source_sha256": "7ebf69038ab345b229c82d997235767ee8be9654b79d9918be7bea16fd9be8e6", "ja": "は、はい。すみません、遅れました。\n仕事が押しちゃって……。", "zh": "是、是的。抱歉，我来晚了。工作耽搁了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "f678a4afd9131e5eee7bf6aeaaa0c91a637c9838a433609c0fd481683a5cf153", "ja": "可憐さん、お気になさらず～。\nこれくらいで、遅刻とは言いませんよ～。", "zh": "可怜小姐，请别放在心上～。\n这种程度可不算迟到哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "1404e4807c6065adef3a311e78f115c0ec2ab964b08f3cadfe1777bdfaac69cd", "ja": "（対応が全然違う）", "zh": "（待遇完全不一样）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "539e11141e78f716d818797ed367d1df7ded05cad93f62a0a01b5777bb9511fa", "ja": "なにか～？", "zh": "什么事～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "0094e9f7039153874f22f699b521ef6f120e09083bd2455abd1375a3bcb4693a", "ja": "い、いや、なんでも……じゃあ、早速はじめよう！\nまず、みんなにはこの曲を聞いてもらいたい。", "zh": "没、没什么……那我们赶紧开始吧！\n首先，想让大家听一下这首歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "0307ec4c510333a2a1337891820ccfbdec8746706653a6869b65ef01def68ac0", "ja": "と、とってもいい曲ですね……！\nピアノの音がすごくオシャレ……♪", "zh": "这、这首歌真的很好听呢……！\n钢琴声特别有品位……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1022_038chz", "source_sha256": "4df965dc8dea7f3d132e26f5f9e128924690da10b594f653affd81813a49278c", "ja": "ええ、切ないメロディですわね……。\n歌詞もなんだか、いじらしくて……素敵ですわ！", "zh": "嗯，是首令人心酸的旋律呢……\n歌词也不知怎么的，让人怜爱……真是太棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1023_031tom", "source_sha256": "7a3816cdce87097f2dd2bc2d40b93a916352b83c38af624dbad204709e9acd55", "ja": "はい～。歌詞を通して、込められた\n熱情が伝わってくるようです～。", "zh": "是的～。透过歌词，仿佛能感受到其中蕴含的热情～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "7b015462e5cb78668169fbf244d0ddae6d6931968548f81cdb3bc0aa66567ecc", "ja": "それで、3人での新ユニットを想定してるんだけど……\nみんなスケジュール、今厳しいんだよな……。", "zh": "所以，我设想的是由3人组成的新组合……\n但大家最近的日程都很紧张啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1025_038chz", "source_sha256": "ee336e24a6d2b570a5ca7a0d49713a48d5e44d0f555180bf0b46a5e5d0cf8f40", "ja": "そうですわね。仕事もありますが……大学で、\nどうしても落とせない講義がありまして。", "zh": "是啊。虽然也有工作……但我在大学里，有一门无论如何都不能缺席的课。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1026_031tom", "source_sha256": "383253340d1698e52d7e2580a29c3594c66090f292e830c25445a9f02bc30bcf", "ja": "私も小さな取材や撮影が多いので、まとまった\n時間は取りにくいかもしれませんね～。", "zh": "我也经常有一些零散的采访和拍摄，恐怕很难抽出整段时间呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1027_045kar", "source_sha256": "b0ca14712a7be9a8f3e8fc597b3dcf736111eceb67c7795c360a6e07512155ef", "ja": "わ、私は地方でのロケが、連続してて……。\n練習時間は取れると思いますけど……でも……。", "zh": "我、我在外地的拍摄工作接连不断……。\n练习时间应该还是能抽出来的……但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1028_p", "source_sha256": "1cb8e3a665639db786b076c0e7a155ddf42e48f7b147bac07d338a652d4b307c", "ja": "そうなんだ。それぞれの練習時間は確保できても、\n集まれる時間が極端に少ない。", "zh": "这样啊。就算能确保各自的练习时间，能聚在一起的时间也少得可怜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1029_p", "source_sha256": "af24688e2d5b5308be24598d4c2a2508fee66529c443b322968f7d769c3ab3a4", "ja": "みんなで合わせる機会がないようだと正直、\nユニットとして、まとまるかどうか……。", "zh": "要是没有大家一起磨合的机会，说实话，\n作为组合到底能不能协调好……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1030_031tom", "source_sha256": "15f7abdd454c387c7bc8e6364cd1a06219390baa5adb3b8bb9caef2ada065668", "ja": "あら～？　これは{$P$}さんの\n不安を聞くミーティングでしたか～？", "zh": "哎呀～？这是倾听{$P$}先生烦恼的会议吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1031_p", "source_sha256": "5b3b2fa10bb4f0088b707607d1b441a2e79a7dda5c93bc473dd7eeede0d102c2", "ja": "ま、まあ不安なのは確かだ。\nスケジュールが厳しいのも、事実で……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯……确实让人感到不安。  \n行程安排很紧也是事实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1032_045kar", "source_sha256": "751a4209dfac3bd9a4915ded39fcc715aad06db21da56ccc1aef928ab7b987db", "ja": "あ、あの……。でも、もし、\n本当に不可能なスケジュールなら……。", "zh": "啊，那个……可是，如果真的是不可能的日程安排……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1033_045kar", "source_sha256": "291f9fbd0fb294e4da8035a94e7ade10e965c8a720f327371e506928770c75a0", "ja": "{$P$}さん、最初から\n提案自体をしないはず……ですよね……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生从一开始\n就不会提出这个方案……对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1034_038chz", "source_sha256": "41b914da4c8fa2ecde27740876a7bbe8c869d1040a37b85ca69d24c02636a7f4", "ja": "そうですわ。つまり、このミーティングの\n目的はわたくし達の意思確認……ですわよね？", "zh": "就是这样。也就是说，这次会议的目的，是确认我们这边的意愿……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1035_031tom", "source_sha256": "98ac00417a4d7fe015f76ea059eb947b60b5cfe88520960bc2a3c8bd9d70506a", "ja": "なるほど～？　そういう事ならそのように\nきちんと、言って欲しいですね～。", "zh": "原来如此～？既然是这样，就请好好把话说明白嘛～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1036_p", "source_sha256": "379abf057d98b5e2a4a2f81c20b4f8a90b5303d80f53c04f24414982aa13c293", "ja": "朋花、千鶴さん、可憐……。ああ、その通りだな。\nまどろっこしい言い方はやめにするよ。", "zh": "朋花、千鶴、可憐……。啊，说得对。\n我就不拐弯抹角了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1037_p", "source_sha256": "9f96d438a9aef8d524cbac39f0c55a526a5f949bc4a4494a602765f02b6fb5f1", "ja": "どうしても3人に頼みたい。スケジュール調整は\nこちらでなんとかする。……やってくれるか？", "zh": "无论如何，我都想拜托3人。日程安排这边会想办法协调。……你们愿意帮忙吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1038_031tom", "source_sha256": "c86db99b981dd7ff983789b4910d9b3558187efc01c35d169b4b1872ee042a90", "ja": "ふふ……それでいいんです～。子豚ちゃん達に、\n早くこの曲を聴かせてあげなくては～。", "zh": "呵呵……这样就好～得赶紧让小猪们听到这首歌才行～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1039_038chz", "source_sha256": "4a3e6ea509e8cacc85fa452cb7949322d2e88ead635b2d575dd87628c31dcf3e", "ja": "もちろんですわ。一流の人間は、\nチャンスをみすみす逃したりしませんもの。", "zh": "那是当然。一流的人，\n可是绝不会平白错失良机的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1040_045kar", "source_sha256": "156b7f3a6f8db8560da471e9006e9fc03065114495bd0f993f1903263b37d253", "ja": "ま、任せてください！\n私、精一杯頑張りますから……。", "zh": "嘛，交给我吧！\n我会竭尽全力的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0174_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_01_1041_p", "source_sha256": "52a42fbbdf492580d513711b7335b01d68276857e96d8d5eda476fc6c9efa720", "ja": "（みんな、やる気を見せてくれている。\nこっちも全力でプロデュースしないとな！）", "zh": "（大家都展现出了干劲。我这边也得全力以赴做好制作人的工作才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
